The Real Talk First
At 8 hrs/week, you're looking at ~400 hours/year. To become a genuinely employable AI engineer by 2028 (roughly 2 years from now = ~800 hours total), this is tight but doable if you stay ruthlessly focused on what matters and cut everything that doesn't.
